 you study? ↘","books, notes, and pens ↘"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Report a statement.","pt":"Relate.","model":"She said she was ready."},{"q":"Use told me.","pt":"Use.","model":"He told me he would come."},{"q":"Use look into.","pt":"Use.","model":"I will look into the problem."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences in reported speech.","model":"Leo said that he was tired. He told me that he was busy. Ana said she would call. Mia told us she was ready. They said they would look into it.","checklist":["Usei **said/told**","Usei **recuo de tempo**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “phone call” mean?","opts":["dia ocupado","confusão de recados","telefonema"],"ans":2,"why":"**phone call** = telefonema."},{"q":"What does “busy day” mean?","opts":["dia ocupado","voz cansada","fofoca de escritório"],"ans":0,"why":"**busy day** = dia ocupado."},{"q":"What does “tired voice” mean?","opts":["confusão de recados","voz cansada","linha de relato"],"ans":1,"why":"**tired voice** = voz cansada."},{"q":"What does “message mix-up” mean?","opts":["fofoca de escritório","retorno de ligação","confusão de recados"],"ans":2,"why":"**message mix-up** = confusão de recados."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}